Explanation:

- We insert at the top of the existing `'link'` array a new pattern that matches exactly `` `some text <URL>`_ ``.
- We give it the alias `url` so Prism will color it appropriately.
- We still leave the original `[text]_(…)` and bare-backtick link rules intact, but pushed one position down.
- Because this runs before the italic and literal rules, your `` `ALTER ROLE <…>`_ `` snippet will now be tokenized as a URL rather than mis-picked up as italic.
